# [IVY](../wg/ivy.html)

## Summary

The IVY (Network Inventory Service and Data Model) Working Group met at IETF 127. The session covered progress updates and open issues on active working group documents near Working Group Last Call (WGLC), including software, location, and entitlement inventory models. The group also discussed the newly adopted passive network inventory draft, focusing on scope definitions, and reviewed a proposal for cryptographic asset discovery and inventory (CADI) in the context of Post-Quantum Cryptography (PQC) migration.

